+Stock selection retains deterministic acquisition-sequence ordering, with existing new-copy sequences preceding B5’s used-copy day sequences. Explicit copy controls let the player allocate a particular copy. Broader shopping/substitution behavior remains B6/backlog. Reloading an older checkpoint still discards later unsaved actions; repeated commands within one saved history cannot create another payment/copy. Existing save flush/rename, Retry save and terminal archive behavior remain; no new power-loss or packaged-save claim is made.
